<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Great Prophet of my God,</l><l>My tongue would bless Thy name;</l><l>By Thee the joyful news</l><l>Of our salvation came;</l><l>The joyful news of sins forgiv’n,</l><l>Of death annulled, and Thy life giv’n.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus, my great High Priest,</l><l>Offered His blood, and died;</l><l>My guilty conscience seeks</l><l>No sacrifice beside:</l><l>His pow’rful blood did me redeem,</l><l>’Tis worthy of my heart’s esteem.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I love my Shepherd’s voice:</l><l>His watchful eye shall keep</l><l>My wand’ring soul among</l><l>The thousands of His sheep:</l><l>He feeds His flock, He calls their names,</l><l>His bosom bears the tender lambs.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>My Savior and my Lord,</l><l>My Conqu’ror and my King,</l><l>Thy scepter and Thy sword,</l><l>Thy reigning grace I sing:</l><l>Thine is the pow’r; behold I sit</l><l>In willing bonds beneath Thy feet.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
